  "content": "<p>-暫停中-</p><p>需要一個 Minecraft 伺服器嗎？</p><p>請前往 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><cite>https://www.bisecthosting.com</cite></a></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/yTefaG2TNlQ\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>這個模組將主世界取代為沙漠，沙漠中將充滿廢墟、競爭的拾荒者和廢料。&nbsp;</p><p>不推薦使用 1.20.4 版本，因為這些版本缺少使用 Ad Astra 資源的功能。</p><p>注意：建議搭配 Oculus 和 Complementary Shaders 使用，以獲得最佳視覺效果。&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oculus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oculus</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/complementary-unbound\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Shaders</a></p><p>請在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252flutri_2\" rel=\"nofollow\">buymeacoffee</a> 上支持我</p><p>計畫中的內容？</p><p>以下是我希望在這個模組中實現的一些內容：</p><ul>\n<li>來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blue Skies</a> 的內容</li>\n<li>更多來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ad-astra\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ad Astra</a> 的內容</li>\n<li>更多建築物</li>\n<li>更多自訂生物</li>\n</ul><p>進度：&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>沙漠：&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;建築物：&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;生物：&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;物品/戰利品：&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;村莊：&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;雜項：&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p>25%&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 20%&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 20%&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;10%&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;50%&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;5%</p>",
